estimated_minutes: 300
acceptance_criteria: Unmatched removal fails or requires an explicit allow-noop contract; replacing nonempty acceptance criteria is explicitly named and reports discarded entries; one-entry repair has an atomic operation that preserves unrelated criteria; CLI SDK MCP bulk transaction help and completions share semantics; tests cover delimiter normalization composed flags warnings exits and history atomicity
goal: project management = context management
objective: Make acceptance-criteria mutations lossless and failure-atomic
value: Agents cannot silently erase closure contracts while repairing one criterion
why_now: GitHub #956 demonstrates a successful zero-exit path that destroys unrelated acceptance criteria
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: high
confidence: high
severity: high
expected_result: Repairing one criterion preserves every unrelated criterion or fails without mutation
actual_result: An unmatched remove plus replacing --ac exits successfully and drops other criteria
